# The repo root .gitignore excludes *.csv, *.log and any directory called "generated", but
# everything under this directory is stage *evidence* and has to be tracked:
#
#   *.csv       raw Tracy ops CSVs (their ATTRIBUTES column proves which program configs
#               actually ran), the filtered tt-perf-report CSVs the perf tables are derived
#               from, and the core-grid sweep data;
#   *.log       the console logs for the definitive test/perf runs and the $autofix
#               localization, plus each Tracy session's pytest log;
#   generated/  watcher writes its log under <TT_METAL_LOGS_PATH>/generated/watcher/.
#
# scripts/render_evidence.py reads the CSVs and gates the committed numbers against them.
!*.csv
!*.log
!generated/
